ial site"},{"text":"Programme requirements"}],[{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"University of British Columbia, Queen's University"},{"text":"University funding"},{"text":"Programme requirements"}],[{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"UNSW, Curtin University, University of Queensland"},{"text":"University/government scholarships — check the official site"},{"text":"Programme requirements"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Application pack"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strong CGPA"},{"text":"Mine-survey internship"},{"text":"Total-station/GNSS experience"},{"text":"CAD/GIS portfolio"},{"text":"Drone/photogrammetry project"},{"text":"Mine-planning project"},{"text":"Research experience"},{"text":"Strong recommendation letters"},{"text":"Statement of Purpose"},{"text":"Academic transcripts"},{"text":"English-language test if required"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For this career, postgraduate study in Mining Engineering, Geomatics, Geoinformatics, Remote Sensing/GIS or Mine Planning can provide a strong specialisation."}]},{"heading":"Going forward","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech Mining Engineering","Mining Survey Intern","GET / Junior Survey Engineer","Assistant Mine Surveyor / Mine Survey Engineer","Mining Surveyor","Senior Mine Surveyor","Surveying Lead / Mine Planning Specialist","Chief Mine Surveyor / Technical Services Lead","Mine Planning Manager / Technical Services Manager","Mining Operations / Digital Mining Leadership"]},{"type":"p","text":"For statutory mine-surveyor positions, progression depends on the current applicable qualification, certification and experience requirements."},{"type":"h","text":"Potential PhD routes"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mining Engineering"},{"text":"Mine Surveying"},{"text":"Geomatics Engineering"},{"text":"Geoinformatics"},{"text":"Remote Sensing"},{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"Photogrammetry"},{"text":"LiDAR"},{"text":"Mine Planning"},{"text":"Rock Mec